14:04.272 --> 14:10.595
[SPEAKER_00]: So actually this is very useful for you in creating inventions.

14:11.675 --> 14:15.057
[SPEAKER_00]: This is very good for you.

14:15.237 --> 14:17.318
[SPEAKER_00]: Your mind starts to work out what it is.

14:17.438 --> 14:18.138
[SPEAKER_00]: What level is that?

14:19.383 --> 14:22.964
