15:11.011 --> 15:12.112
[SPEAKER_02]: Money matters a lot.

15:14.371 --> 15:16.312
[SPEAKER_02]: And a knowledge person would know that.

15:16.592 --> 15:16.832
[SPEAKER_02]: Yes.

15:17.293 --> 15:18.673
[SPEAKER_00]: Do you want to go on to the next scroll?

15:19.494 --> 15:20.154
[SPEAKER_02]: Uh, yeah.

